From e80387f573e1144f2120a26c13f20649e7114d62 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kgvarunkanth <kgvarunkanth@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 07:02:47 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] mido: brand the kernel KGV-Pro-X

Release string 4.9.x-KGV-Pro-X, without the git hash suffix.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/mido_defconfig | 1 +
 localversion                      | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/mido_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/mido_defconfig
index fed16fc13..88695cdf9 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/mido_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/mido_defconfig
@@ -706,3 +706,4 @@ CONFIG_CRYPTO_AES_ARM64_CE_BLK=y
 CONFIG_CRYPTO_AES_ARM64_NEON_BLK=y
 CONFIG_CRYPTO_CRC32_ARM64=y
 CONFIG_QMI_ENCDEC=y
+# CONFIG_LOCALVERSION_AUTO is not set
diff --git a/localversion b/localversion
index 73678162f..e83d21d2e 100644
--- a/localversion
+++ b/localversion
@@ -1 +1 @@
-~zLOS
+-KGV-Pro-X
-- 
2.53.0

